# Pairs with AtomicOnOwner. The decision needs only one prepared key, so one
# key surfaces the batch while the other has no bucket yet.
MODULE: AtomicOnOwnerFoldDecideBeforeDispatch
TARGET: AtomicOnOwner
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the saga records its commit before every entry is dispatched
PERTURBS: SagaDecide

--- FIND
    /\ prepped = Keys
    /\ dec' = "committed"
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: one dispatched entry is enough.
    /\ prepped # {}
    /\ dec' = "committed"
--- END
